  "final_answer": "I have completed the task. Here is the USB-C hub that matches all your requirements:\n\n## **Anker USB C Hub, 7in1 Multi-Port USB Adapter** — #1 Best Seller\n\n**Product Details:**\n- **Full Title:** Anker USB C Hub, 7in1 Multi-Port USB Adapter, 4K@60Hz USBC to HDMI Splitter | 85W Max PD, 2 USB 3.0 & 1 USBC Data Ports, SD/TF Card Reader, for Laptops/Mac and Other Type C Devices (Charger Not Included)\n- **Price:** **$21.99** (with 15% savings from list price of $25.99) ✅ Under $50\n- **Rating:** 4.5 out of 5 stars (5,210 reviews)\n- **Best Seller Rank:** #1 Best Seller (10K+ bought in past month — Amazon's \"Overall Pick\")\n- **ASIN:** B0DXJQT19B\n- **URL:** https://www.amazon.com/Anker-Multi-Port-Splitter-Delivery-Included/dp/B0DXJQT19B\n\n**Ports (7-in-1, well above the 4-port requirement):**\n- 1 × HDMI 2.0 port (4K@60Hz)\n- 2 × USB-A 3.0 ports (5Gbps)\n- 1 × USB-C data port (5Gbps)\n- 1 × USB-C PD input (up to 85W charging)\n- 1 × SD card slot\n- 1 × TF (microSD) card slot\n\n**Compatibility:** ✅ Fully compatible with MacBook computers that support USB-C with DP Alt Mode and Power Delivery, USB4 and Thunderbolt 3/4/5 ports — works with MacBook Pro.\n\n**Summary:** This product was the top result after sorting by Best Sellers and satisfies every constraint — it's compatible with MacBook Pro, has 7 ports (including HDMI and SD/TF card readers), and is priced at $21.99, well under $50.",
